  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunkCode":"chunk.sample.memory.lru.rule","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","title":"LRU 的规则与命中更新","chunkType":"ALGORITHM",
      "contentMd":"LRU 在需要换出页面时，选择过去最长时间没有被访问的驻留页。\n\n1. 页面命中：更新该页的最近访问状态。\n2. 页面未命中且仍有空页框：装入页面并记录最近访问。\n3. 页面未命中且页框已满：换出最近最久未访问的页，再装入新页。\n\n比较的是最近访问时间，不是首次调入时间。可以用时间戳或维护最近访问顺序的结构实现。",
      "nodeCodes":["os.memory.lru"],"assets":[],
      "sourceRef":{"sourceCode":"sample.oslab","origin":"SELF_AUTHORED_SAMPLE","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","pageStart":null,"pageEnd":null,"locator":"自编算法规则示例","sourceQuestionNumber":null}
    },
    {
      "chunkCode":"chunk.sample.memory.lru.example","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","title":"3 页框下的 LRU 推演","chunkType":"WORKED_EXAMPLE",
      "contentMd":"条件：3 个页框，初始为空，访问序列为 `1,2,3,1,4`。表内顺序为最近访问到最久未访问，并非物理页框位置。\n\n|访问|最近访问顺序|结果|换出|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|1|1|缺页|无|\n|2|2,1|缺页|无|\n|3|3,2,1|缺页|无|\n|1|1,3,2|命中|无|\n|4|4,1,3|缺页|2|\n\n第 4 步对页面 1 的命中更新了访问顺序，因此最后换出页面 2，而不是页面 1。总缺页次数为 4。",
      "nodeCodes":["os.memory.lru"],"assets":[],
      "sourceRef":{"sourceCode":"sample.oslab","origin":"SELF_AUTHORED_SAMPLE","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","pageStart":null,"pageEnd":null,"locator":"自编五步访问例子","sourceQuestionNumber":null}
    },
    {
      "chunkCode":"chunk.sample.memory.lru.summary","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","title":"LRU 学习小结","chunkType":"SUMMARY",
      "contentMd":"你应能够根据访问历史选出 LRU 换出页，并解释为什么命中也要更新访问顺序。\n\n若把 LRU 与 FIFO 混淆，可回看同一序列：FIFO 依据调入先后，LRU 依据最近访问。接下来可比较 OPT，或进入代码实现实验。",
      "nodeCodes":["os.memory.lru"],"assets":[],
      "sourceRef":{"sourceCode":"sample.oslab","origin":"SELF_AUTHORED_SAMPLE","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","pageStart":null,"pageEnd":null,"locator":"自编学习小结","sourceQuestionNumber":null}
    },
    {
      "chunkCode":"chunk.sample.memory.page-comparison","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","title":"三种页面置换算法的比较","chunkType":"EXPLANATION",
      "contentMd":"FIFO 看调入先后；LRU 看过去的最近访问；OPT 看未来的下一次访问。\n\nOPT 需要未来访问序列，通常不能直接用于实际运行时的在线决策。比较算法时，必须使用相同页框数、相同初始状态与相同访问序列。",
      "nodeCodes":["os.memory.fifo","os.memory.lru","os.memory.opt"],"assets":[],
      "sourceRef":{"sourceCode":"sample.oslab","origin":"SELF_AUTHORED_SAMPLE","sectionCode":"sec.memory.page-replacement","pageStart":null,"pageEnd":null,"locator":"自编算法比较","sourceQuestionNumber":null}
    }
